  m_Name: 02_Explain
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Hindsight.Ophthalmology::Hindsight.Ophthalmology.Procedure.Steps.DialogueStep
  title: Why eye drops?
  shotId: DoctorExplain
  doctorAnchorId: 
  teleportDoctor: 0
  doctorPose: 6
  doctorProp: 1
  speaker: Dr. Iris
  lines:
  - To see inside your eye, I need the dark circle in the middle - your pupil - to get BIG.
  - Special eye drops make that happen. Your job is to tilt your head back, keep your eyes open, and stay nice and still.
